# Local config & tooling
# NOTE: pytest.ini, .ruff.toml and alembic.ini must stay tracked — CI's backend
# job runs `ruff check .` and `pytest` (which read the first two), and
# test_database_repair.py plus the slow Alembic round-trip both require
# alembic.ini to exist in the checkout.

# Reference documentation & repair reports
# NOTE: docs/api.md must stay tracked — CI runs
# `generate_api_reference.py --check`, which fails when the file is absent.
docs/calienne_architecture.md
docs/deployment.md
docs/PROJECT_BIBLE.md
evals/runs/

# Research scratch — sub-agent notes, asset generators, arXiv id lists.
# Local-only by design; curated findings live in research/ (stays visible).
.research_tmp/

# Execution replay traces — runtime output written by ReplayStore
# (redacted, but still per-request content; 30-day local retention).
telemetry/replays/

# pyenv local version pin
.python-version
